{"id":"vod_hh_75768","vodId":"75768","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士零一 中文配音","name_cn":"假面骑士零一 中文配音","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第46集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/0cfbf0e4c879fff26ee9f6c2bf21e438.jpg"},"summary":"这是新时代骑士与人工智能的正面交锋。故事背景设定为迎来新时代的日本。引领人工智能潮流的公司——“飞电智能”，研发了一款AI机器人，并将其投入到实际运用中。它们完美融入了职场，把新时代朝着电子化的方向推进。但妄图灭绝人类的恐怖分子“灭亡迅雷站”黑了机器人的系统使之暴走。在这样的情况下，政府成立了专门针对AI犯罪的人工智能特务机关，来镇压暴走的AI机器人，维持治安。在一系列事件中，以成为搞笑艺人为目标的主角——飞电或人成了中心人物。在被炒鱿鱼的主人公面前出现了一辆无人驾驶的高档车，然后他突然间被告知，自己要继承飞电智能公司社长的宝座……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-03-13 10:42:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":46,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyGPZ6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGO6LKd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejmRXyd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQpWo5e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejmRX4d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXzDgvb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepvY4yb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepvYNQb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8v2jre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAGDvjd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/neloYB1d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZB6Age/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6q8DNa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOnYWRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKjrg8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerxkKpb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVxmpvb/index.m